Z||000006||Cozmo||07-14-2001||03:03 PM||||Here's a pic of my '87 Duke coupe with an aero nose and no other ground effects.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/dukewing.JPG"> <BR>  I painted thw lower edges in front of the front wheels black to blend the lines into the black non-aero rockers and rear fascia.  I also added a black character stripe around the lower part of the car to tie it all together.  I think coupes look really smooth in white with the aero nose, you just got to blend it into the rest of the car...<BR>{BTW, IGNORE the MR2 wing on it, we just set it on there to see how it looked...UGLY  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> )<BR><B>C02M0</B>||||reg||1
